%% Complex OTA / DFU decision graph: nested subgraphs, many branches, mixed shapes.
flowchart TB
  subgraph Device [Device Cortex-M4]
    direction TB
    Boot[Boot ROM] --> App{App valid?}
    App -->|yes| Run[Run application]
    App -->|no| Recov[Recovery loader]
    Run --> Idle([Idle advertising])
    Idle --> Recv{{GATT DFU write}}
  end

  subgraph Host [Host CI]
    direction LR
    Build[Firmware build] --> Sign[Sign plus hash]
    Sign --> Pub[Publish MQTT ota/offer]
  end

  subgraph Transport [Transport]
    MQTT[MQTT ota/chunk]
    GATT[BLE ATT Write Cmd]
    UART[UART SLIP]
  end

  Recv --> Auth{HMAC valid?}
  Auth -->|fail| Nack[NACK fail counter]
  Auth -->|ok| Space{Flash slot free?}
  Space -->|no| Erase[Erase inactive slot]
  Erase --> Space
  Space -->|yes| Xfer[Stream chunks]
  Pub --> MQTT
  MQTT --> Xfer
  GATT --> Xfer
  UART --> Xfer
  Xfer --> CRC{CRC32 match?}
  CRC -->|no| Retry{retries lt 3?}
  Retry -->|yes| Xfer
  Retry -->|no| Abort[Abort keep old image]
  CRC -->|yes| Swap[Swap boot slot]
  Swap --> Reset((Warm reset))
  Reset --> Boot
  Abort --> Idle
  Nack --> Idle
  Recov --> UART
